      "content": "The point of fighting it is the sheer, desperate act of proving the pattern wrong, even if you're already convinced it's true. Delaying it isn't just making it hurt longer; it's giving yourself more time to be a version of yourself that you've already decided is flawed. If the end is certain, then the only real choice left is how you navigate the descent.",
